#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# or

#% text
# `or(a, b, ...)`, written `a or b`, is the logical disjunction, evaluated left to right and stopping at the first `true`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
true or false
#% output
#= true

#% cell
1 > 2 or 3 > 4
#% output
#= false

#% cell
x > 0 or false
#% output
#= x > 0

#% subsection
# Scope

#% text
# A union of intervals:

#% cell
reduce(x < -1 or x > 1, x, reals)
#% output
#= x < -1 or 1 < x

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `and`, `not`, `some`
